WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Everything on Maintenance.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:12.800
Maintenance. Recurring work: lawn care, beds, spring and fall cleanups, snow. Plans put their own visits on the crew's schedule weeks ahead.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:21.533
The numbers. Active plans and visits this week. People who see money also see the yearly value and what is ready to bill.

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:31.967
Yearly increase. Owner and office: raise every plan's price from a date and email each customer. Tour: "Raise maintenance prices for the year".

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:36.367
New plan. Starts a plan; first pick the customer.

00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:45.967
Find the customer. Type a name, phone or street and click them; the plan form opens. Tour: "Set up or change a maintenance plan".

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:50.667
Close the form. The x closes it without starting a plan.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:57.533
Plans. Every plan; the number on each tab is how many. Visits and Billing are next to it.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:01.100
Customer. Who the plan is for, and where.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:10.367
Service and how often. Weekly, every 2 weeks, monthly, quarterly, spring + fall or snow (on call), and the day of the week.

00:01:10.867 --> 00:01:17.933
Season. The months it runs are green; the mark is this month. Visits only go on the schedule in season.

00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:23.367
Crew. The crew that does the visits. With No crew, no visits get booked.

00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:28.633
Price. Per visit, a month (fixed monthly fee), or not billed here.

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:36.100
Next visit. The next booked visit and how many are done this year, or on call, needs a crew, out of season.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.767
Status. Active, Paused or Ended.

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:46.033
Open a plan. Click a plan to change it, move or skip a visit, pause or end it.

00:01:46.533 --> 00:01:49.767
Visits. This week and next, day by day.

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:57.667
The visit board. Each visit is coloured by its crew; faded = done. Click a visit to open the customer.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:01.233
Billing. Month-end billing for maintenance.

00:02:01.733 --> 00:02:08.033
Bill up to. Finished visits and monthly fees up to this date. Change it and the list updates.

00:02:08.533 --> 00:02:16.867
Who gets billed. One draft invoice per customer: a line per finished visit, or the monthly fee for each month in season.

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:24.667
Make the invoices. Creates the draft invoices; check and send them from Invoices. The tour doesn't press it.

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:29.167
Back to the plans. Plans is where most of the work is.

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:35.267
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
